name 'ai-generated-design-preassessment-q10_2025'

question 'A small business owner uses an AI tool to build their website. The AI creates a home page, but some text overlaps with images, and a few links don\'t work. What should the owner do next to act responsibly as the designer?'

wrong 'Refine the prompt or fix the issues, then test the website again.'
right 'Keep the design as it is since the AI created it.'
wrong 'Delete the entire project and start over from scratch.'
wrong 'Copy another company\'s website to save time.
'

allow_multiple_attempts true

